msgid ""
"Uses the same completion base as the reconciliation timeline, grouped by the "
"programme's beneficiary group and split into reconciled and still open "
"values. The chart is stacked, so each bar shows the reconciled and open "
"portions."
msgstr ""

#: src/hope_live/web/chart_metadata.py:251
msgid ""
"The chart shows the top 10 groups. The title and horizontal axis follow the "
"active metric (payment count or amount in USD)."
